            "heading_size": "hxs",
            "text": "<p>Without curiosity, where would we be? The desire to seek out new horizons, to find what happens next, is a driving force as old as the hills, and as old as the vikings. Follow the Norvegr Journey to the North and celebrate the spirit of travel with us.</p>",
